     {
      "segment": {
       "endIndex": 93,
       "text": "This is an **exceptionally strong, top-of-market offer for a Google L6 Senior Product Manager"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 99,
       "endIndex": 225,
       "text": "For context, the median total compensation for a Google L6 PM in the Bay Area typically hovers around **$500,000\u2013$550,000/yr"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 229,
       "endIndex": 313,
       "text": "Your offer significantly outperforms market medians across base, equity, and sign-on"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 374,
       "endIndex": 491,
       "text": "Google uses a **front-loaded vesting schedule** for initial equity (typically **33% / 33% / 22% / 12%** over 4 years)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 495,
       "endIndex": 566,
       "text": "Assuming the standard front-loaded schedule and a Year 1 sign-on payout"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 875,
       "endIndex": 922,
       "text": "| **Equity (RSUs)** | $250,000 | $442,200 (33%)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 875,
       "endIndex": 939,
       "text": "| **Equity (RSUs)** | $250,000 | $442,200 (33%) | $442,200 (33%)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 875,
       "endIndex": 956,
       "text": "| **Equity (RSUs)** | $250,000 | $442,200 (33%) | $442,200 (33%) | $294,800 (22%)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 875,
       "endIndex": 973,
       "text": "| **Equity (RSUs)** | $250,000 | $442,200 (33%) | $442,200 (33%) | $294,800 (22%) | $160,800 (12%)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1033,
       "endIndex": 1080,
       "text": "| **Estimated Refresher**| \u2014 | \u2014 | ~$25,000"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1033,
       "endIndex": 1091,
       "text": "| **Estimated Refresher**| \u2014 | \u2014 | ~$25,000 | ~$60,000"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1033,
       "endIndex": 1104,
       "text": "| **Estimated Refresher**| \u2014 | \u2014 | ~$25,000 | ~$60,000 | ~$110,000+"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1489,
       "endIndex": 1593,
       "text": "Google front-loads initial equity to recruit top talent, which creates an apparent drop in years 3 and 4"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       6
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1599,
       "endIndex": 1693,
       "text": "**The Reality:** Google awards annual equity refreshers (granted each Q1 based on performance)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1695,
       "endIndex": 1762,
       "text": "These refresh grants vest **linearly at 25% per year over 4 years**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1767,
       "endIndex": 1853,
       "text": "By Year 3 and Year 4, multiple refreshers stack on top of your remaining initial grant"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1855,
       "endIndex": 2012,
       "text": "As long as you maintain solid performance (\"Consistently Meets\" or higher), the stacking refreshers generally keep your ongoing TC above **$600k\u2013$650k/yr**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       6
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2469,
       "endIndex": 2536,
       "text": "Since your base ($260k against a $271k maximum) and sign-on ($200k)"
